1
00:00:11,976 --> 00:00:15,524
Excuse-moi, tu as l'heure ?
Excuse me, do you have the time?

2
00:00:15,624 --> 00:00:19,076
Oui, il est trois heures et demie.
Yes, it's half past three.

3
00:00:19,176 --> 00:00:24,956
Oh non ! Le film commence à quatre heures moins le quart !
Oh no! The film starts at quarter to four!

4
00:00:25,056 --> 00:00:29,108
Pas de panique, on a encore un quart d'heure.
Don't panic, we still have a quarter of an hour.

5
00:00:29,208 --> 00:00:32,300
À quelle heure finit le film ?
What time does the film end?

6
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:35,300
À cinq heures et quart.
At quarter past five.

7
00:00:35,400 --> 00:00:39,980
Parfait. On mange à sept heures ?
Perfect. Shall we eat at seven?

8
00:00:40,080 --> 00:00:43,076
Oui, à sept heures !
Yes, at seven!
